  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "My big sister collects shards.\r",
        "She says they remind her of the place\n",
        "she worked at long ago."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "If you find ten shards of the same\n",
        "color, please let me know.\r",
        "I would gladly trade you a Technical\n",
        "Machine for them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve got ten shards in the same\n",
        "color, haven’t you?\r",
        "Would you like to trade them for\n",
        "a Technical Machine?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "For your ten Red Shards, you get\n",
        "this {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "For your ten Blue Shards, you get\n",
        "this {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "For your ten Yellow Shards, you get\n",
        "this {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "For your ten Green Shards, you get\n",
        "this {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t want anything?\n",
        "I feel unwanted..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, your Bag is full.\r",
        "Giggle... It’s OK, I can trade\n",
        "anytime. Next time will be fine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1119_SR212BR0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Red Shards: Sunny Day\n",
        "Blue Shards: Rain Dance\\fYellow Shards: Sandstorm\\fGreen Shards: Hail\\f...The Weather Institute"
      ]
